# PLACEHOLDER -- Industrial Hemp: the crop's 14 stages, Ditchweed (a copy of stage 5, as Wild Lemon
# Haze copies Lemon Haze's) and the seeds.
#
# Fibre hemp is sown dense, so its lower leaves shade out and drop: a bare, straight stalk with a tuft
# at the top, never Lemon Haze's leafy column. That silhouette is the whole identity. Paler and
# yellower than either smoking strain, yellowing further as it ripens (y), and the ripe tuft carries
# pale seed heads (f) instead of orange pistils. Drawn in the style of Warlon Mhite's crop art --
# one-pixel stalk at column 8, leaflets as single pixels -- so it sits beside it.
#
# The stage models parent hempdustry:block/tinted_crop, so these colours are pulled towards the
# biome's grass at biomeTintStrength.

@palette hemp
. = none
s = 5B8440  stalk
S = 76A052  stalk, lit
l = 6FA24F  leaflet
L = 93C06A  leaflet, lit
y = B9B764  yellowing leaf
f = D8CF9A  seed head

@texture block/industrial_hemp_crop_stage0 16x16 palette=hemp type=plant
